# Tests for the Knockouts_household module (issue #37)

Run with `clerk test`. GENERATED from the knockout table of `catala/knockouts_household.catala_en`.
Each knockout case sets just that condition on a clean return and checks that
the combined flag is true and that the list of reasons is exactly that one
reason; the clean return has no reason. A known-bad output (a flag without a
reason, a reason that did not fire) is rejected by the exact assertions. The
born-and-died knockout is computed here from the member data: three boundary
cases show that each of its three tests is needed. Checklist DF fact to Catala
name: `docs/knockout-inventory.md`. Oracle comparison:
`make difftest SCOPE=calculator` (`/flowIsKnockedOut`).

> Using Types
> Using Knockouts_income as KI
> Using Knockouts_household as KH

